vUheMpSCArlDGsBk9CZk1acADPm18JoCtw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZxfbJU7VkONicFDiacBlF0iaccb5sAFARolV1vqrnBstnTKS0VC8OXgtDNvoHPvX7gudANXqtKI9V7LPCHouxqAfjibjDybJ13Iz0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>     为了促进全国各高校马克思主义理论学科优秀大学生的互动与交流，培养大学生从事科学研究的兴趣，并为优秀本科生提供了解我院学术科研环境和与专家、学者交流的机会。我院将于2026年7月10日举办“马克思主义学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”。夏令营采取线上线下结合方式，欢迎相关学科的优秀同学踊跃报名（本校同学线下参营，建议成都地区高校同学线下参营，其他同学线上参营）。</span></p><p><span>     学院概况和师资详情可查看四川大学马克思主义学院官网http://mkszy.scu.edu.cn/。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kZB4eLYgOZTriaTC3kz25jYCuIdSUuF65fFKxs3N1t6GwHib3sgc2QSvPQhlZpp3wDI7ygVzia1YmPjN0X3iah7oQJicQYEAvSS6oyM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kYrnsdw9pR5RIXkc4GD8EfErowqtX0YLRcEuQIuZvWQNiaACwM7cjegr8cwY2vRZVrfXLxFLLFasBcYUsw8Libuaw0mQ6kicb50es/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Part</span></strong><strong><span>.01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZnYYvEC891I677opUctzZkBcMbLINs2q4lar8mOGuyPnFib4bQ2HfmEPphqQ8yyia2xb5ykC0qPtiaIkGicoCdpqVmYD6o053NfDk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>夏令营介绍</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZkgJxthpymyOvpp16vxBA1pk2CRF2IpgcrovIAWwrI65SYh7s2CD92yQk2SJhCiaDx30PffmNZNTVq11J05pNS6kyCibSOicsDgw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kY3Ign6FicXxYEYSIbV2vw1ialU6m5lqXbEwuaR0EldOS4mekXTzY4Af9ApUuLG8dns4EZlSfp8fjM3pUibentCpr8qibAsG6OCdwk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kZLsmPZ1I5jf0SxRPN4DZHGzWicNh5giborziaI0wmQvuTGG8tAcmrMuDibPhQqeuWviaySNn5v98p3O2NKe1hiaYzwUbiaf4CVOug6icQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>      夏令营期间将进行一系列活动，如学院宣传及学科介绍、专家讲坛、营员与导师交流等活动。现面向全国高校招收营员100名，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kY76ALTvEbE7eFga6ZyVexVlhLhSWgN6aWCMIRTFjiatib5O32y3oT46YaeBboJLLZ3ibwpyO5qDVIpicvkmqibB0E1Lx2DIuGpXibtA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kb3jicg9zSp5qxXmqdRDxR8tonefx7X3Wh3LJwaUQGXPkPn0WGibraiaz8eDgoicoy4EWR3WAMUKs90qwMwWZ4ibzqzAvjgh0MNMfNY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kYcDstEEhFicuks7AR2n5xgnUNDcxCiaGricOCBMpPicTlLJ2UnKdBnvOCCpduqerI02Klkrd40leh9MmFDc5YhTwSOKmOzqAPKbU4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>一、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZXSUIOt7VlkceCkGnTQB1bicHTJFK0f2nhuicSdYPQBp6pjuOMkF5sPJgq9aMlSp8YGfHkHLPytpHaEAtw1F5yxGazlRWTzqT6w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、全国各高校马克思主义理论相关学科的三（四）年级本科生（2027届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2、学习成绩优秀，本科期间综合成绩原则上要求排名前15%；</span></p><p><span>3、对从事马克思主义理论相关学科的学术研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能；</span></p><p><span>4、大学英语四级考试成绩500分以上或通过大学英语六级考试（425分以上）或TOEFL、GRE等考试成绩优秀者。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kaWeanvQRzcRXAbETRiabEpia7nDSnrXFliblw3Wq67vCzO63LwLVgdnzl8AhX4VnPF4oJ4j8vVo5hM6kUOJWicVxyicqxHs5v9oyS0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZk0rkpcuWzrr738diaGafxtkY1ML8BlhOsVLtsPJqp0Z9szySMCTiaoY0eMRJ4qP71DN3uAVJjh1VAR6elLLkeM21WCCtlHggicg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、申请表（报名成功后由系统自动生成，下载后经所在单位推荐盖章后再上传至系统）；</span></p><p><span>2、本科成绩单和专业排名证明（各1份，需加盖所在学校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>3、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件等。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kaFQlybic9KdSDdBd7Qc8rTGsXicEOnTJYCHSILUsFE006jWkv4eONOnUbsQiaicpVf1XYZX0zfOYOAGu1dwLaj96dwDkXj7or7lV4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请办法及时间</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZUtIIVScicz9AGb7ibOJ86TthUJ34JlahkqoViaJ72YJX0a5UsE61cIBiaydnQ5whL3dHC51IJlEk0y5J0O9EQMNibOBY6jryShu3w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、报名方法：</span></p><p><span>申请人登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平（https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly）进行报名，并将申请表、本科成绩单、专业排名证明、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件的电子文档上传报名系统按顺序扫描合并成一个压缩文件，在志愿列表中直接点击“上传（更新）附件”上传至报名系统（未提供申请表或申请表未盖章的材料评议不予加分）。</span></p><p><span>2、报名时间：</span></p><p><span>自即日起开始报名，截止日期2026年7月5日。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kZ5XOjeawviaC7ictBMGRj92Kn3LmdkKibwvUHfeSszu9hFBje3Ip5nh4TlEvMpRQFXvzicfKHWvnfbDAdDd0kn264Sg9IxcibNZlpU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>四、审核录取</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kYtF9EuIe7P9uZ0j3YIzqBSI7Kj1icfxnt3evtT4PxKKQfItB4UhJofibNcdrDMrfoxY4uG1jS0rfWOm7E12icc4C6P8vFH5pfib3M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>     夏令营的材料审核与录取工作预计在2026年7月7日前结束，请于7月8日自行登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly）查询，系统中未查询到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知，录取营员于7月8日17:00前在系统里确认能否准时参营，未确认者视为放弃。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6kaOvC7jrS4E9ORE8gUMEaDdQp6QnvJYfmmItLtxcypxTziaqTDzYfoicEPjWdsVUAkU24QV4mfjFMPts64Iq0uJCFdkV5VF99TKU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>五、注意事项</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kY2QbeH5Iian2PBIr1qVXicQIjY6VoF7Gfe3EXL7cCDG5E3jdh7XaOeicictZ2I4Nib4Aq6JlTmlBeeVoawvU28ouEyUpGeT9bJQLcU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、在营期间进行的一切相关活动，禁止录音录像。</span></p><p><span>2、在营期间，营员必须遵守四川大学的相关规定。</span></p><p><span>3、线下营员前来参加夏令营活动，需告知所在学校和父母，在征得同意后注意出行安全。对因违反四川大学相关规定和营员手册等规章制度导致的安全事故，由本人承担所有责任。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LVkk5PNC6ka5uibXzosIgIrZkl6zGkLyoyAU0yRPfpDMiaBAJdazU1NAvBeg8T5HEdGDfG0m4t1py41ETYVV5KYKZUZ5RRtPniajUZRPVVsVA8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>六、联系方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kZ3sMaVPLRe4NGMXRCwbMMdFBewMtIibBCymiaDtPml2BIA551eibex3DfyWGZzCaZAaolViaC80HR6K1q0UZN7N7KoKxxmMiczMqs8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：乔老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：028-85996283</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LVkk5PNC6kaAvWI0ngiadRhsXMorArqtpfEBCMLiaYYwXDicIsrMEUJAvrKS11RmFKGVEXWk8skPg1gcC9owrCyPRpL8funIAGSN0PyicOtXfIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c037f099f4665cabc94bd4cc131bb1a95e9f012f285b3044e8174f9eb429f596","textLength":1121,"sourceSha256":"60a26de32aff27280127ae829e9d0f977313c05b818bc2fbc6e9bb811349dedc","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6f1e12cff99a002c6a85","title":"2026年四川大学马克思主义学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:50.674291+00:00"}
